#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2026-12-31
# The repo is public on purpose (FYP requirement; gives free branch rules and CodeQL). Trivy flags the public
# repository declared in infra/github/main.tf as CRITICAL. Both ID formats are listed for older/newer Trivy.
GIT-0001
AVD-GIT-0001
